  "name": "Question 14",
  "problem": "The systolic blood pressure of adults in a given population is normally distributed with a mean of $123.4\\,\\text{mm}\\,\\text{Hg}$ and a standard deviation of $19.5\\,\\text{mm}\\,\\text{Hg}.$ Suppose $10$ adults are randomly selected. What is the probability that the mean systolic blood pressure for this sample will be between $120\\,\\text{mm}\\,\\text{Hg}$ and $125\\,\\text{mm}\\,\\text{Hg}?$ \n\n*Hint: A table of values of $Φ(z)$ for different values of $z$ is given below, where $Φ(z)$ is the cumulative distribution function for the standard normal distribution. * \n\n<table align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> \n  <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.04\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.05\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.06\\,$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.5\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2946\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2912\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2877\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.4\\,$</th>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3300\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3264\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3228\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.3\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3669\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3632\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3594\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></th>\n<th width=\"5%\"></th>\n\n<th><p></p>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> \n  <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.04\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.05\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.06\\,$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.0\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5160\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5199\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5239\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.1\\,$</th>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5557\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5596\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5636\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.2\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5948\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5987\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6026\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></th>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
